{%- comment -%}
	Offer popup — the first-visit 10% off signup (popup v2, Tom's brief of
	11 Oct 2026 and his consolidated list of the same day). Replaces the
	September launch popup and its reveal-card gift mechanic in place; nothing
	of that mechanic remains.

	Rendered from layout/theme.liquid as a static section, so it stays editable
	in the theme editor, but it only renders on the homepage and the kit page,
	in English until the Arabic strings exist, and never for a logged-in
	customer who has ordered. The QR insert's own popup is the separate
	sections/newsletter-popup.liquid and is not touched.

	Four screens in one dialog:
	  1  the forced choice: "Want 10% off your kit?" yes / no thanks
	  2  two chip rows, "What's it for?" and "Who's it for?", multi-select,
	     both required, Continue disabled until each visible row has a tick.
	     Each row has its own switch; both off skips the screen.
	  3  the email and the button
	  4  success: the code, a copy button and "Add to cart, 10% applied"

	Submission is a native full-page POST, never fetch: newsletter-form wraps
	{% form 'customer' %}, which is what creates the subscriber Klaviyo syncs,
	and Shopify injects an invisible captcha into it (it may detour through
	/challenge). The redirect comes back as ?customer_posted=true#offer-popup
	on the page the visitor signed up on, and this section reopens straight at
	screen 4, which is the form's server-rendered success state. That is also
	why the discount code only ever appears in the HTML after a successful
	post (brief §7).

	Applying the code (GET /discount/<code>, the 30-day suppression and the
	remembered code the cart drawer reads) is snippets/signup-offer.liquid,
	driven by data-offer-code on the success block, so the footer signup gets
	the identical step. This script owns timing, screens, tags and analytics.

	Screen 4's button adds the kit through a cart/add form so the drawer's
	document-level handler runs: on the kit page that is the buy box form, on
	the homepage a hidden form rendered below the dialog. Both carry the free
	pouch's variant id, which is what makes the drawer send the pouch along.

	Storage (all reads and writes wrapped in try/catch):
	  localStorage.aira_popup_until        do not arm before this time
	  localStorage.aira_popup_code         the code earned (drawer Checkout link)
	  sessionStorage.aira_popup_shown      shown this tab session
	  sessionStorage.aira_popup_closed_at  the exit overlay waits 60 s after this
	  sessionStorage.aira_popup_answers    the screen 2 ticks, read back on return
	  sessionStorage.aira_exit_shown       written by the exit overlay; blocks us
	  sessionStorage.aira_utm              landing-page utm_content / utm_campaign

	Test switches: ?popup=now opens at once, ?popup=off never opens. Both are
	moot while the enable switch is off, because nothing renders.
{%- endcomment -%}

{%- liquid
	assign popup_page = ''
	if template.name == 'index'
		assign popup_page = 'index'
	elsif template.name == 'product' and product.handle == 'aira-kit'
		assign popup_page = 'product'
	endif

	assign popup_on = section.settings.popup_enabled
	if request.design_mode
		assign popup_on = true
	endif
	if popup_page == blank
		assign popup_on = false
	endif
	if request.locale.iso_code != 'en' and section.settings.popup_enable_on_ar != true
		assign popup_on = false
	endif
	if customer and customer.orders_count > 0
		assign popup_on = false
	endif
-%}

{%- if popup_on -%}
	{%- liquid
		assign kit_product = all_products['aira-kit']
		assign kit_in_cart = false
		for item in cart.items
			if item.product.handle == 'aira-kit'
				assign kit_in_cart = true
				break
			endif
		endfor

		assign offer_code = settings.offer_discount_code | strip
		assign checkout_url = routes.root_url | append: '/checkout' | replace: '//', '/'
		assign code_param = offer_code | url_encode
		assign checkout_discount_url = checkout_url | append: '?discount=' | append: code_param
		assign popup_tags = 'popup-v2, src:' | append: popup_page | append: ', ad:none, camp:none'
		assign image_alt = 'sections.offer_popup.image_alt' | t
		# The setting carries a literal "{{ code }}" placeholder. Replaced here, inside
		# a tag, because an output tag would end at the placeholder's own braces.
		assign code_html = '<code class="font-mono font-bold text-main" data-popup-code>' | append: offer_code | append: '</code>'
		assign success_body_html = section.settings.success_body | replace: '{{ code }}', code_html

		assign ask_rows = false
		if section.settings.popup_ask_for or section.settings.popup_ask_who
			assign ask_rows = true
		endif

		# The homepage's hidden kit form needs the free pouch's variant for the
		# drawer to send the pouch along. The buy box resolves it from its own
		# section settings (sections/product.liquid, "Launch offer"); those are
		# not readable from here, so this mirrors its defaults: the refill
		# product's 30-pair variant, else its first available one. When the
		# launch offer ends, untick it there and clear this too.
		assign gift_variant = nil
		if popup_page == 'index'
			assign gift_product = all_products['aira-refill-tabs']
			if gift_product != blank
				for v in gift_product.variants
					if v.title == '30'
						assign gift_variant = v
						break
					endif
				endfor
				if gift_variant == nil
					assign gift_variant = gift_product.first_available_variant
				endif
			endif
		endif
	-%}

	{%- capture popup_step_one -%}
		<div data-popup-step="1" class="px-6 text-center">
			{%- if section.settings.eyebrow != blank -%}
				<p class="font-heading text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-copy">{{ section.settings.eyebrow }}</p>
			{%- endif -%}
			<h2 id="offer-popup-heading" class="mt-2 font-heading font-bold text-2xl leading-tight text-main text-balance">{{ section.settings.heading }}</h2>
			{%- if section.settings.subheading != blank -%}
				<p class="mx-auto mt-3 max-w-sm text-base leading-relaxed text-copy text-balance">{{ section.settings.subheading }}</p>
			{%- endif -%}
			<div class="mt-6 flex flex-col items-center gap-3">
				{%- render 'cta-button',
					label: section.settings.yes_label,
					element: 'button',
					variant: 'shop',
					size: 'lg',
					full_width: true,
					attributes: 'data-popup-action="yes"'
				-%}
				<button type="button" class="py-2 text-sm font-semibold text-copy underline-offset-4 hover:underline cursor-pointer" data-popup-action="no">
					{{ section.settings.no_label }}
				</button>
			</div>
		</div>
	{%- endcapture -%}

	{%- comment -%}
		Screen 2. Checkbox chips: multi-select, keyboard-operable (Tab, Space),
		nothing checked on load. White, 1px navy border, 44px tall; a checked
		chip shows its tick and a second navy ring. The ring is inset so the
		chip's size never changes. The inputs carry no name: they sit outside
		the customer form and the script writes the ticks into contact[tags]
		at submit time.
	{%- endcomment -%}
	{%- capture popup_chip_rows -%}
		{%- assign row_keys = 'for,who' | split: ',' -%}
		{%- for row in row_keys -%}
			{%- liquid
				if row == 'for'
					assign row_on = section.settings.popup_ask_for
					assign row_label = section.settings.for_label
					assign row_values = 'for:snoring,for:sleep,for:training,for:blocked-nose' | split: ','
				else
					assign row_on = section.settings.popup_ask_who
					assign row_label = section.settings.who_label
					assign row_values = 'who:me,who:partner,who:other' | split: ','
				endif
			-%}
			{%- if row_on -%}
				<fieldset class="m-0 min-w-0 border-0 p-0" data-popup-row="{{ row }}">
					<legend class="mb-2 text-sm font-semibold text-main">{{ row_label }}</legend>
					<div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2">
						{%- for chip in row_values -%}
							{%- liquid
								case chip
									when 'for:snoring'
										assign chip_label = section.settings.for_snoring
									when 'for:sleep'
										assign chip_label = section.settings.for_sleep
									when 'for:training'
										assign chip_label = section.settings.for_training
									when 'for:blocked-nose'
										assign chip_label = section.settings.for_nose
									when 'who:me'
										assign chip_label = section.settings.who_me
									when 'who:partner'
										assign chip_label = section.settings.who_partner
									else
										assign chip_label = section.settings.who_other
								endcase
							-%}
							<label class="inline-flex min-h-11 cursor-pointer items-center rounded-full border border-main bg-bg px-4 text-base font-semibold text-main has-checked:ring-1 has-checked:ring-inset has-checked:ring-main has-focus-visible:outline-2 has-focus-visible:outline-offset-2 has-focus-visible:outline-highlight">
								<input type="checkbox" value="{{ chip }}" class="peer sr-only" data-popup-chip="{{ chip }}">
								<svg class="me-1.5 hidden h-4 w-4 shrink-0 peer-checked:block" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m5 13 4 4L19 7"/></svg>
								<span>{{ chip_label }}</span>
							</label>
						{%- endfor -%}
					</div>
				</fieldset>
			{%- endif -%}
		{%- endfor -%}
	{%- endcapture -%}

	{%- capture popup_step_two -%}
		{%- if ask_rows -%}
			<div data-popup-step="2" class="pe-8" hidden>
				<h2 id="offer-popup-heading-2" class="sr-only">{{ section.settings.for_label }} {{ section.settings.who_label }}</h2>
				<div class="flex flex-col gap-5">
					{{ popup_chip_rows }}
				</div>
				<div class="mt-6">
					{%- render 'cta-button',
						label: section.settings.continue_label,
						element: 'button',
						variant: 'shop',
						size: 'lg',
						full_width: true,
						disabled: true,
						attributes: 'data-popup-action="continue"'
					-%}
				</div>
			</div>
		{%- endif -%}
	{%- endcapture -%}

	{%- capture popup_fields -%}
		<p class="text-sm font-semibold text-highlight" data-popup-error role="alert" hidden></p>
	{%- endcapture -%}

	{%- comment -%}
		Screen 4. Only output inside the form's posted_successfully? branch, so
		the code is never in the page before a post succeeds.
	{%- endcomment -%}
	{%- capture popup_success -%}
		<p class="text-base leading-relaxed text-copy">
			{{ success_body_html }}
			<button
				type="button"
				class="ms-1 inline-flex items-center rounded-lg border border-main/30 px-2.5 py-1 align-middle text-xs font-semibold text-main transition-colors hover:border-main cursor-pointer"
				data-popup-action="copy"
				data-copied-label="{{ 'sections.offer_popup.copied' | t }}"
			>{{ 'sections.offer_popup.copy' | t }}</button>
		</p>
		<div class="mt-5 flex flex-col items-center gap-3">
			{%- if popup_page == 'product' and kit_in_cart -%}
				{%- render 'cta-button',
					label: section.settings.cta_checkout_label,
					url: checkout_discount_url,
					variant: 'shop',
					size: 'lg',
					full_width: true,
					attributes: 'data-popup-action="checkout"'
				-%}
			{%- else -%}
				{%- render 'cta-button',
					label: section.settings.cta_kit_label,
					element: 'button',
					variant: 'shop',
					size: 'lg',
					full_width: true,
					attributes: 'data-popup-action="add_to_cart"'
				-%}
			{%- endif -%}
			<button type="button" class="py-2 text-sm font-semibold text-copy underline-offset-4 hover:underline cursor-pointer" data-popup-action="keep" data-modal-close>
				{{ 'sections.offer_popup.keep_browsing' | t }}
			</button>
		</div>
	{%- endcapture -%}

	{%- capture popup_step_three -%}
		<div data-popup-step="3" hidden>
			{%- if section.settings.popup_image != blank -%}
				{%- comment -%}
					A <template> is inert: the browser fetches nothing inside it. The
					script clones it into the slot when this screen opens, so the
					image costs no request on page load (brief §7).
				{%- endcomment -%}
				<template data-popup-image>
					<div class="mb-5 -mx-5 overflow-hidden sm:mx-0 sm:rounded-xl">
						{%- render 'image', image: section.settings.popup_image, width: 600, alt: image_alt -%}
					</div>
				</template>
				<div data-popup-image-slot></div>
			{%- endif -%}
			<div data-popup-intro class="pe-8">
				<h2 id="offer-popup-heading-3" class="font-heading font-bold text-2xl leading-tight text-main text-balance">{{ section.settings.email_heading }}</h2>
				{%- if section.settings.email_sub != blank -%}
					<p class="mt-2 text-base leading-relaxed text-copy text-balance">{{ section.settings.email_sub }}</p>
				{%- endif -%}
			</div>
			<div class="mt-5">
				{%- render 'newsletter-form',
					form_id: 'offer-popup',
					tags: popup_tags,
					placeholder: section.settings.placeholder,
					button_label: section.settings.submit_label,
					button_variant: 'shop',
					layout: 'stacked',
					fields_html: popup_fields,
					show_states: true,
					success_icon: true,
					success_classes: 'text-center',
					success_heading: section.settings.success_heading,
					success_html: popup_success,
					offer_code: offer_code,
					offer_days: section.settings.popup_signup_days
				-%}
			</div>
		</div>
	{%- endcapture -%}

	{%- capture popup_body -%}
		{{ popup_step_one }}
		{{ popup_step_two }}
		{{ popup_step_three }}
	{%- endcapture -%}

	{%- capture popup_attrs -%}
		data-popup
		data-popup-page="{{ popup_page }}"
		data-popup-kit-in-cart="{{ kit_in_cart }}"
		data-popup-home-delay="{{ section.settings.popup_home_delay_seconds }}"
		data-popup-pdp-delay="{{ section.settings.popup_pdp_delay_seconds }}"
		data-popup-pdp-scroll="{{ section.settings.popup_pdp_scroll_percent }}"
		data-popup-dismiss-days="{{ section.settings.popup_dismiss_days }}"
	{%- endcapture -%}

	{%- render 'modal-dialog',
		id: 'offer-popup-modal',
		variant: 'sheet',
		labelledby: 'offer-popup-heading',
		body: popup_body,
		attributes: popup_attrs
	-%}

	{%- if popup_page == 'index' and kit_product != blank -%}
		{%- comment -%}
			The homepage has no buy box, so screen 4 submits this instead. It
			sits outside the dialog because the success block lives inside the
			customer form and forms cannot nest. No button: the script calls
			requestSubmit(), which fires the submit event the drawer intercepts.
		{%- endcomment -%}
		<form action="{{ routes.cart_add_url }}" method="post" hidden data-popup-kit-form{% if gift_variant %} data-gift-variant-id="{{ gift_variant.id }}"{% endif %}>
			<input type="hidden" name="id" value="{{ kit_product.selected_or_first_available_variant.id }}">
			<input type="hidden" name="quantity" value="1">
		</form>
	{%- endif -%}

<script>
(function () {
	var section = document.querySelector('#shopify-section-{{ section.id }}');
	if (!section) return;

	var modal = section.querySelector('[data-popup]');
	var card = modal && modal.querySelector('[data-modal-card]');
	if (!modal || !card) return;

	var MODAL_ID = modal.id;
	var FORM_ID = 'offer-popup';
	var UNTIL_KEY = 'aira_popup_until';
	var SHOWN_KEY = 'aira_popup_shown';
	var CLOSED_KEY = 'aira_popup_closed_at';
	var ANSWERS_KEY = 'aira_popup_answers';
	var EXIT_KEY = 'aira_exit_shown';
	var CLOSE_BUTTON_DELAY = 4000; /* screen 1 shows its X after this; "No thanks" and Esc are always there */
	var RETRY_MS = 2000;           /* another overlay was open at fire time: try again */
	var MAX_RETRIES = 30;

	var cfg = modal.dataset;
	var page = cfg.popupPage;
	var designMode = !!(window.Shopify && window.Shopify.designMode);
	var screens = {
		1: card.querySelector('[data-popup-step="1"]'),
		2: card.querySelector('[data-popup-step="2"]'), /* null when both rows are switched off */
		3: card.querySelector('[data-popup-step="3"]')
	};
	var closeBtn = card.querySelector('[data-modal-close]');
	var form = card.querySelector('#' + FORM_ID);
	var continueBtn = card.querySelector('[data-popup-action="continue"]');
	var screen = 1;
	var submitted = false;
	var closeReason = null;
	var tracked = {};
	var answers = { for: [], who: [] };

	function local() { try { return window.localStorage; } catch (e) { return null; } }
	function session() { try { return window.sessionStorage; } catch (e) { return null; } }
	function read(store, key) { try { return store ? store.getItem(key) : null; } catch (e) { return null; } }
	function write(store, key, value) { try { if (store) { store.setItem(key, value); } } catch (e) {} }

	/* Custom pixels only; no gtag, no fbq (see the WhatsApp click in sections/footer.liquid). */
	function publish(name, data) {
		if (designMode) return;
		if (window.Shopify && Shopify.analytics && Shopify.analytics.publish) {
			Shopify.analytics.publish(name, data);
		}
	}
	function clarity(state) {
		if (typeof window.clarity === 'function') { window.clarity('set', 'popup', state); }
	}
	function utm() {
		return window.airaOffer ? window.airaOffer.utm() : { ad: 'none', camp: 'none' };
	}
	/* One aira_popup_step per screen per page load, so drop-off per screen
	   can be read without double counting a screen shown twice. */
	function trackScreen(n) {
		if (tracked[n]) return;
		tracked[n] = true;
		var u = utm();
		publish('aira_popup_step', { step: n, page: page, utm_content: u.ad, utm_campaign: u.camp });
	}

	function suppressed() {
		if (designMode) return false;
		var until = parseInt(read(local(), UNTIL_KEY), 10);
		return !!until && until > Date.now();
	}
	function suppressFor(days) {
		if (designMode) return;
		write(local(), UNTIL_KEY, String(Date.now() + (parseInt(days, 10) || 7) * 864e5));
	}
	function blocked() {
		return suppressed() || read(session(), SHOWN_KEY) === '1' || !!read(session(), EXIT_KEY);
	}

	function showScreen(n) {
		screen = n;
		[1, 2, 3].forEach(function (i) { if (screens[i]) { screens[i].hidden = i !== n; } });
		modal.setAttribute('aria-labelledby', n === 1 ? 'offer-popup-heading' : 'offer-popup-heading-' + n);
		trackScreen(n);
	}

	function loadImage() {
		var tpl = card.querySelector('[data-popup-image]');
		var slot = card.querySelector('[data-popup-image-slot]');
		if (!tpl || !slot || slot.firstChild) return;
		slot.appendChild(tpl.content.cloneNode(true));
	}

	function goEmail() {
		showScreen(3);
		loadImage();
		if (closeBtn) { closeBtn.hidden = false; }
		var email = form && form.querySelector('input[type="email"]');
		if (email) { email.focus(); }
	}

	/* ── Screen 2 ── */
	function rowsComplete() {
		var rows = screens[2] ? screens[2].querySelectorAll('[data-popup-row]') : [];
		return Array.prototype.every.call(rows, function (row) {
			return !!row.querySelector('[data-popup-chip]:checked');
		});
	}
	function readAnswers() {
		var picked = { for: [], who: [] };
		if (!screens[2]) return picked;
		Array.prototype.forEach.call(screens[2].querySelectorAll('[data-popup-chip]:checked'), function (chip) {
			var tag = chip.getAttribute('data-popup-chip');
			var key = tag.split(':')[0];
			if (picked[key]) { picked[key].push(tag.slice(key.length + 1)); }
		});
		return picked;
	}
	function wireChips() {
		if (!screens[2] || !continueBtn) return;
		screens[2].addEventListener('change', function () {
			continueBtn.disabled = !rowsComplete();
		});
	}

	/* ── Screen 4 ── */
	function addKit() {
		/* requestSubmit fires the submit event the cart drawer listens for, so
		   the free pouch and the drawer opening are the same as a tap on Add to
		   cart. form.submit() would skip that and do a full POST to /cart/add.
		   The kit page uses its buy box form, the homepage the hidden form
		   rendered under the dialog. */
		var kitForm = document.querySelector('[data-product-section] form[action*="/cart/add"]')
			|| document.querySelector('[data-popup-kit-form]');
		if (!kitForm) return;
		var button = kitForm.querySelector('[data-add-to-cart]');
		if (button && button.disabled) return;
		if (kitForm.requestSubmit) { kitForm.requestSubmit(); } else if (button) { button.click(); }
	}

	function copyCode(button) {
		var codeEl = card.querySelector('[data-popup-code]');
		var text = codeEl ? codeEl.textContent.trim() : '';
		if (!text || !navigator.clipboard) return;
		navigator.clipboard.writeText(text).then(function () {
			var label = button.textContent;
			button.textContent = button.getAttribute('data-copied-label') || label;
			window.setTimeout(function () { button.textContent = label; }, 2000);
		}).catch(function () {});
	}

	function onAction(e) {
		var el = e.target.closest ? e.target.closest('[data-popup-action]') : null;
		if (!el) return;
		var action = el.getAttribute('data-popup-action');

		if (action === 'yes') {
			publish('aira_popup_step1', { choice: 'yes' });
			if (screens[2]) {
				showScreen(2);
				if (closeBtn) { closeBtn.hidden = false; }
				var first = screens[2].querySelector('[data-popup-chip]');
				if (first) { first.focus(); }
			} else {
				goEmail();
			}
		} else if (action === 'continue') {
			if (!rowsComplete()) return;
			answers = readAnswers();
			write(session(), ANSWERS_KEY, JSON.stringify(answers));
			goEmail();
		} else if (action === 'no') {
			closeReason = 'no';
			window.airaModal.close(MODAL_ID);
		} else if (action === 'copy') {
			copyCode(el);
		} else if (action === 'add_to_cart') {
			closeReason = 'add_to_cart';
			publish('aira_popup_cta', { action: action });
			window.airaModal.close(MODAL_ID);
			addKit();
		} else if (action === 'checkout') {
			/* A link: the page leaves, the dialog never closes. */
			closeReason = action;
			publish('aira_popup_cta', { action: action });
		} else if (action === 'keep') {
			closeReason = 'close';
			/* data-modal-close does the closing. */
		}
	}

	function onClose() {
		var reason = closeReason;
		closeReason = null;
		write(session(), CLOSED_KEY, String(Date.now()));

		if (submitted) {
			if (!reason || reason === 'close') { publish('aira_popup_cta', { action: 'close' }); }
			return;
		}
		if (screen === 1) { publish('aira_popup_step1', { choice: reason === 'no' ? 'no' : 'close' }); }
		suppressFor(cfg.popupDismissDays);
		clarity('dismissed');
	}

	function wireForm() {
		if (!form) return;
		var email = form.querySelector('input[type="email"]');
		var errorEl = form.querySelector('[data-popup-error]');
		if (email) {
			/* The browser's own bubble is replaced by the inline line under the
			   field; preventDefault on `invalid` is what suppresses the bubble. */
			email.addEventListener('invalid', function (e) {
				e.preventDefault();
				if (errorEl) {
					errorEl.textContent = {{ 'sections.offer_popup.error_email' | t | json }};
					errorEl.hidden = false;
				}
				email.setAttribute('aria-invalid', 'true');
				email.focus();
			});
			email.addEventListener('input', function () {
				if (errorEl) { errorEl.hidden = true; }
				email.removeAttribute('aria-invalid');
			});
		}
		form.addEventListener('submit', function () {
			/* One tag per screen 2 tick goes into contact[tags] here; ad:/camp:
			   are filled by snippets/signup-offer.liquid on the same event.
			   Klaviyo reads the tags as the profile's Shopify Tags. */
			var tags = form.querySelector('input[name="contact[tags]"]');
			if (!tags) return;
			var base = tags.value.replace(/,\s*(for|who):[^,]*/g, '');
			var extra = [];
			['for', 'who'].forEach(function (key) {
				answers[key].forEach(function (value) { extra.push(key + ':' + value); });
			});
			tags.value = extra.length ? base + ', ' + extra.join(', ') : base;
		});
	}

	/* ── Showing ── */
	function show(how) {
		write(session(), SHOWN_KEY, '1');
		showScreen(1);
		if (closeBtn) {
			closeBtn.hidden = true;
			window.setTimeout(function () { closeBtn.hidden = false; }, CLOSE_BUTTON_DELAY);
		}
		window.airaModal.open(MODAL_ID);
		var u = utm();
		publish('aira_popup_shown', { page: page, trigger: how, utm_content: u.ad, utm_campaign: u.camp });
		clarity('shown');
	}

	function attempt(how, tries) {
		if (document.hidden) {
			/* Background tab: wait until it is looked at, then show. */
			document.addEventListener('visibilitychange', function once() {
				if (document.hidden) return;
				document.removeEventListener('visibilitychange', once);
				attempt(how, tries);
			});
			return;
		}
		/* Re-checked at fire time: a second tab or the exit overlay may have
		   spent the gate since the timer was armed. */
		if (blocked()) return;
		if (window.airaModal.isAnyOpen()) {
			/* Never over the drawer, a lightbox, the menu or another dialog.
			   Try again shortly rather than losing the show. */
			if (tries < MAX_RETRIES) { window.setTimeout(function () { attempt(how, tries + 1); }, RETRY_MS); }
			return;
		}
		show(how);
	}

	function arm() {
		var timer = null;
		var onScroll = null;
		var armed = true;

		function fire(how) {
			if (!armed) return;
			armed = false;
			if (timer) { window.clearTimeout(timer); }
			if (onScroll) { window.removeEventListener('scroll', onScroll); }
			attempt(how, 0);
		}

		if (page === 'product') {
			timer = window.setTimeout(function () { fire('time'); }, (parseInt(cfg.popupPdpDelay, 10) || 30) * 1000);
			var depth = (parseInt(cfg.popupPdpScroll, 10) || 50) / 100;
			/* Measured each time, never cached: the reviews grow the page after
			   load. Lenis drives window.scrollY itself, so this reads the real
			   position on desktop too. */
			onScroll = function () {
				var track = document.documentElement.scrollHeight - window.innerHeight;
				if (track > 0 && window.scrollY / track >= depth) { fire('scroll'); }
			};
			window.addEventListener('scroll', onScroll, { passive: true });
		} else {
			timer = window.setTimeout(function () { fire('time'); }, (parseInt(cfg.popupHomeDelay, 10) || 10) * 1000);
		}
	}

	/* assets/aira-modal.js is deferred, so it has not run yet while this inline
	   script is parsed. Deferred scripts do finish before DOMContentLoaded. */
	if (window.airaModal) { boot(); }
	else { document.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', boot); }

	function boot() {
		if (!window.airaModal) return;

		/* A no-op on first load. In the theme editor a settings change
		   re-renders this section and runs this script again, and the dialog
		   the registry holds is by then a detached node: hand it the new one. */
		window.airaModal.register(modal);
		modal.addEventListener('aira:modal:close', onClose);
		card.addEventListener('click', onAction);
		wireChips();
		wireForm();

		var params = new URLSearchParams(window.location.search);
		var ownsPost = window.location.hash === '#' + FORM_ID;
		var successBlock = card.querySelector('[data-newsletter-success]');
		var errorBlock = card.querySelector('[data-newsletter-error]');

		/* Another customer form's error re-render paints the page-global error
		   into this hidden card too. Stated as "not my anchor" so a further form
		   on the page cannot reintroduce the bug. */
		if (!ownsPost && errorBlock) {
			errorBlock.remove();
			errorBlock = null;
		}

		if (ownsPost) {
			/* Back from our own post, on the page the visitor signed up on:
			   straight to the result, no delay. Screens 1 to 3 are not tracked
			   again; only screen 4 fires. */
			var intro = card.querySelector('[data-popup-intro]');
			if (successBlock) {
				submitted = true;
				if (intro) { intro.hidden = true; }
				write(session(), SHOWN_KEY, '1');
				try { answers = JSON.parse(read(session(), ANSWERS_KEY)) || answers; } catch (e) {}
				var u = utm();
				publish('aira_popup_submit', {
					for: answers.for || [],
					who: answers.who || [],
					page: page,
					utm_content: u.ad,
					utm_campaign: u.camp
				});
				clarity('submitted');
				tracked[3] = true;
				showScreen(3);
				trackScreen(4);
				window.airaModal.open(MODAL_ID);
			} else if (errorBlock) {
				try { answers = JSON.parse(read(session(), ANSWERS_KEY)) || answers; } catch (e) {}
				showScreen(3);
				loadImage();
				window.airaModal.open(MODAL_ID);
			}
			/* The browser's deferred scroll-to-fragment can land after open()
			   and drop focus back on the page behind the dialog. */
			window.addEventListener('load', function () {
				if (window.airaModal.isOpen(MODAL_ID) && !card.contains(document.activeElement)) {
					var target = card.querySelector('[data-newsletter-success]') || card.querySelector('input[type="email"]');
					if (target) { target.focus(); }
				}
			});
			return;
		}

		/* The footer posted on this page load: its success block is in this
		   hidden card too (form state is page-global). Do not pitch someone
		   who has just signed up; signup-offer has already applied their code. */
		if (successBlock) return;

		if (params.get('popup') === 'off') return;
		if (params.get('popup') === 'now') { show('manual'); return; }

		if (designMode) {
			/* Theme editor: open when the merchant selects this section and
			   close when they move on. No timers, no storage, no events. */
			document.addEventListener('shopify:section:select', function (e) {
				if (e.detail && e.detail.sectionId === '{{ section.id }}') { showScreen(1); window.airaModal.open(MODAL_ID); }
			});
			document.addEventListener('shopify:section:deselect', function (e) {
				if (e.detail && e.detail.sectionId === '{{ section.id }}') { window.airaModal.close(MODAL_ID); }
			});
			return;
		}

		if (blocked()) return;
		if (cfg.popupKitInCart === 'true') return;

		arm();
	}
})();
</script>
{%- endif -%}

